  button: BIRTHDAY
  riddle: A plate, two presents, three candles, a party hat and a balloon. Somebody
    is a year older.
  hint: 'Stand it upright: the plate flat underneath, the two presents stacked as
    tiers, candles on top and the balloon on the right. The hat hides in the cake.'
  complete: 'HAPPY BIRTHDAY

    Make a wish.'
